theorem k215UnpairAt4220Step9Z (a b c: nat): $ k215PStep (k215UnpairAt4220State k215PNum4220 a b 0 c) = (k215UnpairAt4220State k215PNum4228 a b 0 c) $ = '(eqtr (eqtr (k215PAtCD k215PLookupUnpair4220_4220) (ifeq (eqeq1 k215PGet2_vector) eqid eqid)) (ifpos eqid));

